<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian WAPCO posts sharp drop in profit.</title>
<headline>Nigerian WAPCO posts sharp drop in profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Nigeria's West African Portland Cement (WAPCO) to end-December 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995</p>
<p>     Turnover		9,200  vs 9,100</p>
<p>     Profit before tax   2,400  vs 3,600</p>
<p>     Profit after tax    1,800  vs 3,100</p>
<p>Dividend per share 80 kobo vs 75 kobo</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
</text>
